#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:6
msgid "Touch LCD Shield"
msgstr "Touch LCD 扩展板"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Touch LCD Shield gives the OpenMV Cam a 2.3 inch 320x240 capacitive "
"multi-touch display so you can preview the camera output (and accept input) "
"without a host computer. Two Qwiic headers make it easy to chain extra I2C "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Touch LCD 扩展板为 OpenMV Cam 配备了一块 2.3 英寸 320x240 "
"的电容式多点触控显示屏，让你无需主机即可预览摄像头输出（并接受输入）。两个 Qwiic 接口让你能够轻松串接额外的 I2C 设备。"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Touch LCD Shield product "
"page <https://openmv.io/products/touch-lcd-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"完整的数据手册、照片和订购信息请参阅 `Touch LCD 扩展板产品页面 <https://openmv.io/products/touch-lcd-"
"shield>`_\\ 。"

